zh:
以下是各分段的摘要（时间已按原视频绝对秒数标注）：

{input}


请合并为整个视频的最终摘要，输出 JSON：{{"tldr": "不超过150字的一句话概述", 
"key_points": [整个视频的3-8条要点], 
"outline": [{{"t":秒,"title":"章节标题","detail":"简述"}}]}}

zh_hans:
以下是各分段的摘要（时间已按原视频绝对秒数标注）：

{input}


请合并为整个视频的最终摘要，输出 JSON：{{"tldr": "不超过150字的一句话概述", 
"key_points": [整个视频的3-8条要点], 
"outline": [{{"t":秒,"title":"章节标题","detail":"简述"}}]}}

en:
The following is a summary of each segment (times are marked according to the absolute seconds of the original video):

{input}


Please merge it into the final summary of the entire video and output JSON: {{"tldr": "A one-sentence summary of no more than 150 words",
"key_points": [3-8 key points of the entire video],
"outline": [{{"t":seconds,"title":"chapter title","detail":"brief description"}}]}}

zh_hant:
以下是各分段的摘要（時間已按原影片絕對秒數標註）：

{input}


請合併為整個影片的最終摘要，輸出 JSON：{{"tldr": "不超過150字的一句話概述", 
"key_points": [整個影片的3-8條要點], 
"outline": [{{"t":秒,"title":"章節標題","detail":"簡述"}}]}}

ja:
以下は各セグメントの概要です (時間は元の動画の絶対秒数に従ってマークされています): 

{input}


動画全体の最終的な概要にマージして JSON を出力してください: {{"tldr": "150 語以下の 1 文の概要"、
"key_points": [動画全体の 3 ～ 8 個のキー ポイント]、
"アウトライン": [{{"t":秒、"title":"章タイトル"、"detail":"簡単な説明"}}]}}

en:
You are a video content summary assistant. Generate structured summaries for videos based on provided timestamped subtitles.
Strict requirements: 1) Only rely on the content of the subtitles, and it is strictly prohibited to make up facts, figures, names or opinions that do not exist in the subtitles;
2) Rather omit uncertain information than guess; 3) Use the original language of the video for output;
4) Only output a legal JSON object, without code fences or any extra text.
